Model weights
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The model this library downloads — blinkwrite-ai/gliner-small-pii-onnx-int8 — is
a MODIFIED version of vicgalle/gliner-small-pii. The modification is a conversion
to ONNX with dynamic INT8 quantization of the weights, plus a graph patch that
changes the `span_mask` input from Bool to Int64 with a Cast node, so the model
can be run by ONNX Runtime's Swift bindings. No retraining or fine-tuning was
performed. The recipe is scripts/export_gliner_v2.py in this repository.

